EF AI Workspace: chat page fixes from the retest on Railway dev after 0040 (2026-10-26).

- Other blocks in the platform's own namespace (R-01). The model wrote an empty «```efaiw-brand-guidelines» block before
  a letter and it showed as a code box.
  - utils/efaiwFollowUps.ts: stripFollowUps drops any complete fenced block whose language starts with «efaiw-», not
    only the suggestions block. Display, copy, read aloud and downloads all use it.
- Letters with a letterhead (R-02). Live, a letter carried as an artifact opened with the fund's name, the date and a
  reference number, and its greeting was «سعادة/», so it lost its Word/PDF bar.
  - isDocumentReply reads the first ten non-empty lines, skips «---» rules, and accepts «سعادة/» and «معالي/».
- Numbered slide titles (R-06). The model titled slides «الشريحة 1 — المقدمة» / «Slide 2: Goals».
  - utils/efaiwPptx.ts: bareSlideTitle drops that numbering, so the slide shows «المقدمة»; the deck numbers its pages.

